/**
 * @defgroup RoModular_Repositories_MIDILAR MIDILAR
 * @ingroup RoModular_Repositories
 * @brief MIDI protocol, parsing, routing, timing and real-time devices.
 *
 * | Field | Value |
 * | ----- | ----- |
 * | Role | MIDI protocol data, parsing, routing, timing, transports and devices |
 * | Status | Rebuilding from scratch on the `rebuild` branch; version `0.1.0` scaffold |
 * | Source | [ChecheRomo96/MIDILAR](https://github.com/ChecheRomo96/MIDILAR/tree/rebuild) |
 * | Runtime dependencies | Foundation `1.4.0` or a newer 1.x release, MCC `0.5.1` or a newer 0.x release |
 * | Public CMake target | `MIDILAR::MIDILAR` |
 *
 * The legacy implementation had no consumers and was removed. MIDILAR is
 * rebuilt phase by phase, starting with a MIDI-domain specification, on the
 * same pinned RoModularBuild `v0.4.0` as Foundation and MCC. Signal processing
 * moves to @ref RoModular_Repositories_DspCore "DspCore". The `rebuild` branch merges into `main`
 * once it is stable; until then this portal does not advertise a MIDILAR
 * release.
 */
